unity extended beyond the realm of research."}, "D2S20": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2082, "end": 2197, "text": "He was an dedicated educator, known for his ability to distill complex concepts into accessible, engaging lectures."}, "D2S21": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2198, "end": 2388, "text": "His students, many of whom have gone on to become prominent researchers in their own right, fondly recall his passion for teaching and his unwavering commitment to their intellectual growth."}, "D2S22": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2389, "end": 2497, "text": "The university's annual reports and faculty directories provide further evidence of Chernyaev's affiliation."}}, "candidates": [], "original_cards": [], "initial_answers": ["I.M. Sechenov First Moscow State Medical University"]}

